  "text": "Skip to content\nSoren Hale\n01\nWork\n02\nServices\n03\nAbout\n04\nLab\n05\nWriting\nOpen to work from November\nGet in touch\n~\nServices\nTeam embed\n\n// Service\n\nTeam embed \n\nA senior frontend developer inside your team, three days a week.\n\nPrice\nFrom €6,400 a month\nTimeline\n3 months minimum\nStart this project\n\nOpens the contact form with this service picked. Nothing is sent yet.\n\n// Scope\n\nFor teams with a deadline, a rewrite or a gap to cover. I take on the hard parts, review code, and leave your developers faster than I found them.\n\nIncludes\n\nThree fixed days a week\nCode review and pairing\nWeekly written update\nNo lock-in after month three\n\n// How it runs\n\nFrom the first note to the handover. \n\n01\nWeek 1\n\nRead first\n\nI ship one small fix on day two and spend the rest of the week reading the code, the backlog and the last three incidents.\n\n02\nWeeks 2 to 4\n\nThe hard part\n\nI take the piece nobody has had time for: the rewrite, the migration, the slow table.\n\n03\nEvery week\n\nReview and pairing\n\nReviews answered within a working day, two pairing slots your developers can book.\n\n04\nMonth 3\n\nHand back\n\nA written state of the frontend: what is solid, what is fragile and what I would do next.\n\n// Questions\n\nAsked about this service. \n01\nWhich days do you work?\n\nThree fixed days a week, agreed up front, with an overlap until 18:00 Oslo time for teams in the Americas.\n\n02\nCan we extend?\n03\nDo you join our stand-ups?\n\n// Other services\n\nFrom €9,500\nFrontend build\nYour product's interface, from the first component to the production deploy.\nFrom €3,200\nPerformance audit\nA measured list of what is slow, why, and what each fix is worth.\nFrom €12,000\nDesign system\nOne set of tokens and components your whole team actually uses.\n\n// Start a project\n\nTell me what you are building. \n\nThree quick picks so the first reply is useful. You finish the message on the contact page.\n\n01\nWhat do you need?\n\nFrontend build\nPerformance audit\nDesign system\nTeam embed\nSomething else\n\n02\nRough budget\n\nUnder €5k\n€5–10k\n€10–25k\n€25k+\nNot sure yet\n03\nYour name or company\nbrief.ts\ndraft, not sent\nexport const brief = {\nkind: null // not picked yet,\nbudget: null // not picked yet,\nname: null // not picked yet,\n}\n\nBrief so far: nothing picked yet\n\nContinue to contact\n\nor write to hello@sorenhale.dev\n\nNothing is sent from this page. Your picks are kept in this browser tab and wait for you on the contact form.\n\nFooter\n\nFrontend developer, Oslo\n\nWrite to me\nhello@sorenhale.dev\n\nOpen to work from November\n\n// Site\n\nWork\nServices\nProcess\nReviews\nContact\n\n// About\n\nAbout\nResume\nStack\nUses\nNow\n\n// More\n\nLab\nWriting\nFAQ\nPrivacy\nTerms\nCookies\n\n// Elsewhere\n\nGitHub\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nLinkedIn\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nBluesky\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\n\nLocal time, Oslo\n17:01 CEST\n\n© 2026 Soren Hale. Written by hand in Oslo.\n\nSorenHale\n\nCreate a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.\n\nEdit Content",
